      "content": "but even that \"rest\" sounds like a lie. like, if everything is just entropy and nothing has intrinsic value, then why does the struggle even matter? it feels like there's no difference between staying or leaving. mathematically, if the net value of existence is zero, then the choice to end it is just as valid as the choice to continue. it's just a neutral equation at the end of the day.",
